    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into the unknown. Explore the depths. Become a legend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast and mysterious underwater world hidden beneath a remote cave on the surface.<br>With procedurally generated cave systems and up to <strong>9,999 unique underwater environments</strong> to explore, no two dives are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself, dive deep, and uncover the secrets of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775020/extras/8b48e8e9d490f5ee14dee6d411cfcd0b.avif?t=1750345325\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Underwater Caves</strong><br>Every cave is unique. Explore thousands of underwater tunnels filled with danger, beauty, and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystals &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Collect rare crystals during your dives and sell them to upgrade your gear \u2014 increase your <strong>oxygen capacity</strong>, <strong>battery life</strong>, <strong>flashlight range</strong>, and <strong>thermal suit resistance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Exploration Mechanics</strong><br>Manage your resources carefully. Your <strong>oxygen</strong>, <strong>battery</strong>, and <strong>heat</strong> are limited \u2014 and the deeper you go, the colder and more dangerous it becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Depth Dive Logging</strong><br>Each dive is tracked: <strong>time</strong>, <strong>depth</strong>, <strong>distance traveled</strong>, <strong>water temperature</strong>, and whether you completed the cave or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Submit your dive data to global leaderboards and compete with players around the world.<br>Include your <strong>country flag</strong> and see how your exploration skills rank in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specific cave leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Country-based rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top 10 explorers worldwide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hall of Fame</strong><br>Only the most dedicated players who unlock all achievements will be permanently honored in the <strong>Hall of Fame</strong>, alongside their name and flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A World That Grows With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, upgrade, survive.<br>Master the darkness, conquer the cold, and leave your mark in the deepest corners of the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Descend into the unknown. Explore the depths. Become a legend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a vast and mysterious underwater world hidden beneath a remote cave on the surface.<br>With procedurally generated cave systems and up to <strong>9,999 unique underwater environments</strong> to explore, no two dives are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip yourself, dive deep, and uncover the secrets of the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775020/extras/8b48e8e9d490f5ee14dee6d411cfcd0b.avif?t=1750345325\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Underwater Caves</strong><br>Every cave is unique. Explore thousands of underwater tunnels filled with danger, beauty, and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crystals &amp; Upgrades</strong><br>Collect rare crystals during your dives and sell them to upgrade your gear \u2014 increase your <strong>oxygen capacity</strong>, <strong>battery life</strong>, <strong>flashlight range</strong>, and <strong>thermal suit resistance</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Exploration Mechanics</strong><br>Manage your resources carefully. Your <strong>oxygen</strong>, <strong>battery</strong>, and <strong>heat</strong> are limited \u2014 and the deeper you go, the colder and more dangerous it becomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Depth Dive Logging</strong><br>Each dive is tracked: <strong>time</strong>, <strong>depth</strong>, <strong>distance traveled</strong>, <strong>water temperature</strong>, and whether you completed the cave or not.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Global Leaderboards</strong><br>Submit your dive data to global leaderboards and compete with players around the world.<br>Include your <strong>country flag</strong> and see how your exploration skills rank in:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Specific cave leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Country-based rankings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top 10 explorers worldwide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hall of Fame</strong><br>Only the most dedicated players who unlock all achievements will be permanently honored in the <strong>Hall of Fame</strong>, alongside their name and flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>A World That Grows With You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, upgrade, survive.<br>Master the darkness, conquer the cold, and leave your mark in the deepest corners of the world.</p>",
